1
00:00:22,795 --> 00:00:26,679
♪The night wind shakes off
the withered leaves♪

2
00:00:29,079 --> 00:00:33,694
♪I open the window and gaze at the moon♪

3
00:00:35,567 --> 00:00:40,705
♪Haze spreads across the river,
lanterns drifting♪

4
00:00:42,043 --> 00:00:47,052
♪I hear the memories rustling♪

5
00:00:48,263 --> 00:00:51,184
♪Garden flowers shed petals one by one♪

6
00:00:51,395 --> 00:00:54,486
♪Candlelight flickers,
swaying with melancholy♪

7
00:00:54,783 --> 00:00:59,018
♪I sigh by the lamp over the long night♪

8
00:01:01,003 --> 00:01:03,911
♪Past memories unfold scene by scene♪

9
00:01:04,209 --> 00:01:07,095
♪It's all your face♪

10
00:01:07,405 --> 00:01:12,187
♪Boldly trampling over my heart♪

11
00:01:12,187 --> 00:01:16,767
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for love miswritten♪

12
00:01:16,767 --> 00:01:18,766
♪And another for youth passed♪

13
00:01:18,969 --> 00:01:24,751
♪With endless sorrow,
I once traced your silhouette♪

14
00:01:25,135 --> 00:01:29,446
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for joy and sorrow♪

15
00:01:29,446 --> 00:01:31,954
♪And another for parting and reunion♪

16
00:01:32,200 --> 00:01:42,417
♪I write until splendor fades,
and I am no more♪

17
00:01:45,867 --> 00:01:48,701
=Prelude of the White Snake=

18
00:01:48,701 --> 00:01:51,619
=Episode 5=

19
00:02:06,680 --> 00:02:07,840
Look at you.

20
00:02:08,360 --> 00:02:10,000
Bullying someone on your own turf,

21
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:11,080
that's all you've got?

22
00:02:12,240 --> 00:02:13,960
You're from Jinshan Temple?

23
00:02:15,960 --> 00:02:20,120
I am a lay disciple of Jinshan Temple,

24
00:02:20,319 --> 00:02:23,520
and the most handsome one at that.

25
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:26,560
Right?

26
00:02:26,560 --> 00:02:27,560
Brother...

27
00:02:28,080 --> 00:02:29,080
Who's your brother?

28
00:02:31,439 --> 00:02:33,360
Fine, sister?

29
00:02:35,520 --> 00:02:36,879
What are you looking at?

30
00:02:37,080 --> 00:02:39,680
You're that into Jinshan disciples
at your age?

31
00:02:39,680 --> 00:02:43,840
Too bad,
I'm only into girls like her now.

32
00:02:47,280 --> 00:02:48,280
Get lost!

33
00:02:51,159 --> 00:02:52,400
I just saved you!

34
00:02:52,599 --> 00:02:53,599
Cut the crap.

35
00:02:56,840 --> 00:02:57,840
Where's Rakshasa Bird?

36
00:02:58,360 --> 00:03:02,080
I guess she ran off
after seeing how powerful I am.

37
00:03:29,719 --> 00:03:30,719
Miss Bai,

38
00:03:32,360 --> 00:03:33,360
are you alright?

39
00:03:38,159 --> 00:03:40,879
Miss Bai, what's wrong?

40
00:03:48,840 --> 00:03:51,159
Miss Bai, it's over now.

41
00:03:51,159 --> 00:03:53,680
Don't be afraid.
It was just an illusion.

42
00:03:56,280 --> 00:04:00,080
Young Master Xu,
I saw you in the illusion.

43
00:04:01,960 --> 00:04:02,960
You saw me?

44
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:07,400
I saw you taking a master.

45
00:04:08,120 --> 00:04:09,120
I also saw

46
00:04:09,560 --> 00:04:10,960
that you avoided your aunt

47
00:04:10,960 --> 00:04:12,039
so you wouldn't burden her.

48
00:04:12,039 --> 00:04:13,639
Then a swarm of snakes surrounded you.

49
00:04:13,639 --> 00:04:15,919
Suddenly, a snake lunged at you.

50
00:04:16,079 --> 00:04:17,399
Just as I tried to protect you,

51
00:04:18,040 --> 00:04:22,759
you accidentally stabbed me
with a dagger.

52
00:04:23,720 --> 00:04:24,800
Then I woke up.

53
00:04:26,800 --> 00:04:28,279
That really was my illusion.

54
00:04:28,639 --> 00:04:30,279
I'm sorry for dragging you into it.

55
00:04:31,360 --> 00:04:32,360
No.

56
00:04:33,839 --> 00:04:35,040
You didn't drag me into it.

57
00:04:35,959 --> 00:04:39,519
It means we are destined to meet.

58
00:04:42,879 --> 00:04:43,879
You're overthinking it.

59
00:04:44,959 --> 00:04:45,959
Aren't we?

60
00:04:46,319 --> 00:04:47,319
No.

61
00:04:48,399 --> 00:04:50,519
Hey, are we?

62
00:04:50,920 --> 00:04:51,920
We definitely are.

63
00:04:51,920 --> 00:04:52,920
We're not.

64
00:04:53,319 --> 00:04:54,319
Miss Bai,

65
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:57,600
your attendant, Qing,
is still stuck in there.

66
00:04:58,879 --> 00:05:00,439
Right, what should I do?

67
00:05:01,240 --> 00:05:04,160
(Wait, I should be worrying
about the bird instead.)

68
00:05:06,079 --> 00:05:07,600
Don't worry, Young Master Xu.

69
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:08,720
He can handle it.

70
00:05:12,120 --> 00:05:13,199
He's really fine.

71
00:05:13,399 --> 00:05:14,399
Let's go back.

72
00:05:19,879 --> 00:05:21,040
Yin-Void Illusion reflects

73
00:05:21,040 --> 00:05:22,759
a person's deepest fears and desires.

74
00:05:23,360 --> 00:05:24,759
It either attacks their mind

75
00:05:24,759 --> 00:05:25,879
or numbs their will.

76
00:05:27,439 --> 00:05:28,879
He's not a demon hunter,

77
00:05:29,560 --> 00:05:30,720
so escape won't be easy.

78
00:05:33,120 --> 00:05:34,120
Oh, right.

79
00:05:35,079 --> 00:05:38,079
Young Master Xu, what should we do then?

80
00:05:44,639 --> 00:05:46,360
Don't worry, leave it to me.

81
00:05:55,160 --> 00:05:56,439
(His skills might be weak,)

82
00:05:57,240 --> 00:05:58,439
(but he's quite considerate.)

83
00:06:01,319 --> 00:06:02,360
Do you know how to escape?

84
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:05,839
That old hag killed
many of my fellow disciples.

85
00:06:05,839 --> 00:06:07,399
I've been hunting her for a long time.

86
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:09,800
I noticed she hates
seeing people get affectionate.

87
00:06:11,120 --> 00:06:13,959
Come on, lady,
let me show you how to escape.

88
00:06:19,240 --> 00:06:20,240
What a hard slap!

89
00:06:20,879 --> 00:06:21,879
What a cheap trick!

90
00:06:22,279 --> 00:06:23,959
It's a brilliant move, okay?

91
00:06:24,480 --> 00:06:25,879
You're a guy right now.

92
00:06:25,879 --> 00:06:27,879
As the head lay disciple
of Jinshan Temple,

93
00:06:27,879 --> 00:06:29,199
I'm sacrificing my dignity here.

94
00:06:29,319 --> 00:06:30,360
What's with the coyness?

95
00:06:30,639 --> 00:06:31,639
Just for show.

96
00:06:36,360 --> 00:06:37,560
You like kissing, huh?

97
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:45,439
Then I call the shots.

98
00:06:50,920 --> 00:06:51,920
Look out!

99
00:07:11,879 --> 00:07:12,879
Leifeng Pagoda?

100
00:07:13,199 --> 00:07:14,600
Since you have such a treasure,

101
00:07:14,600 --> 00:07:15,759
why not bring it earlier?

102
00:07:21,399 --> 00:07:23,120
Don't tell me
you don't know how to use it.

103
00:07:25,319 --> 00:07:26,639
I'm just a bit rusty.

104
00:07:34,879 --> 00:07:36,879
Oh no, the spell went wrong!

105
00:07:46,120 --> 00:07:47,360
Don't come any closer!

106
00:08:18,839 --> 00:08:25,560
We're doomed! We're doomed!

107
00:08:25,879 --> 00:08:27,360
Didn't mean to pry into your privacy,

108
00:08:27,480 --> 00:08:28,480
but...

109
00:08:30,519 --> 00:08:31,519
I respect it.

110
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:33,360
What are you respecting?

111
00:08:33,600 --> 00:08:35,320
Qing, what happened?

112
00:08:38,120 --> 00:08:41,559
Ruined! Everything is ruined!

113
00:08:41,559 --> 00:08:43,559
What's ruined? Aren't you fine?

114
00:08:45,320 --> 00:08:46,320
You little...

115
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:47,320
Shut up!

116
00:08:58,200 --> 00:08:59,200
Get back here.

117
00:09:02,799 --> 00:09:03,840
What are you grunting at?

118
00:09:05,360 --> 00:09:06,360
Say what you want to say.

119
00:09:07,039 --> 00:09:08,200
You told me not to speak!

120
00:09:08,919 --> 00:09:09,919
What's going on?

121
00:09:10,879 --> 00:09:11,879
This stupid pagoda

122
00:09:12,240 --> 00:09:13,480
(never works when it should.)

123
00:09:13,679 --> 00:09:14,799
(It just malfunctioned.)

124
00:09:14,879 --> 00:09:17,240
(I told you not to come over,
but you wouldn't listen.)

125
00:09:17,240 --> 00:09:18,320
(You took over my array.)

126
00:09:18,320 --> 00:09:19,519
We've formed a bond.

127
00:09:20,679 --> 00:09:23,840
In other words, I'm now your...

128
00:09:23,840 --> 00:09:24,840
Stop talking!

129
00:09:26,720 --> 00:09:30,759
Qing, did you...

130
00:09:30,759 --> 00:09:31,759
Impossible.

131
00:09:33,039 --> 00:09:34,039
Come here.

132
00:09:35,440 --> 00:09:36,440
Go back.

133
00:09:38,080 --> 00:09:39,080
Squat down.

134
00:09:42,679 --> 00:09:43,759
Reach out your left hand.

135
00:09:45,639 --> 00:09:46,639
Wag your tail.

136
00:09:48,159 --> 00:09:49,159
So well-behaved?

137
00:09:49,399 --> 00:09:50,399
What a nice surprise!

138
00:09:51,080 --> 00:09:52,080
What a tragedy!

139
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:55,039
Don't reveal our identities to anyone.

140
00:09:55,960 --> 00:09:56,960
Rise.

141
00:10:09,279 --> 00:10:10,480
Did I see that right?

142
00:10:10,919 --> 00:10:13,399
That was my temple's
Demon-Subduing Incantation!

143
00:10:14,240 --> 00:10:16,039
When I was slaying demons
three years ago,

144
00:10:16,360 --> 00:10:17,759
I saw your disciples use it.

145
00:10:21,840 --> 00:10:24,720
I am Fahai,
a lay disciple of Jinshan Temple.

146
00:10:24,919 --> 00:10:26,519
May I have your name, brother?

147
00:10:29,120 --> 00:10:31,799
I am Xu Xian, a demon hunter.

148
00:10:32,480 --> 00:10:33,639
Demon hunter?

149
00:10:41,519 --> 00:10:43,440
Well said, well said.

150
00:10:44,399 --> 00:10:46,600
Interesting, very interesting.

151
00:10:47,240 --> 00:10:48,240
What's so interesting?

152
00:10:52,320 --> 00:10:54,200
I think we can
interrogate this demon now.

153
00:11:02,720 --> 00:11:04,559
Why did you massacre Shanyao Village?

154
00:11:05,559 --> 00:11:08,159
And what is your connection
to the white snake demon?

155
00:11:09,600 --> 00:11:10,879
Shanyao Village?

156
00:11:12,159 --> 00:11:14,360
That run-down village on the outskirts?

157
00:11:16,200 --> 00:11:17,519
What's it to me?

158
00:11:18,279 --> 00:11:19,440
And who's white snake demon?

159
00:11:20,559 --> 00:11:21,639
You can play tough,

160
00:11:22,120 --> 00:11:24,639
but I have countless ways
to make you talk.

161
00:11:25,279 --> 00:11:26,279
Just you?

162
00:11:29,440 --> 00:11:30,440
Threats won't work.

163
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:32,000
Even if you kill me,

164
00:11:32,799 --> 00:11:34,480
I won't admit to things I didn't do.

165
00:11:35,440 --> 00:11:37,320
I only kill Jinshan disciples.

166
00:11:37,840 --> 00:11:38,879
They deserve to die!

167
00:11:42,320 --> 00:11:44,399
The villagers of Shanyao were deceived

168
00:11:44,720 --> 00:11:46,399
into feeding themselves
to an evil demon.

169
00:11:46,759 --> 00:11:48,000
I checked the Demon Codex,

170
00:11:48,320 --> 00:11:49,879
only your kind does this.

171
00:11:51,879 --> 00:11:54,399
The demonic energy on this talisman
points to you as well.

172
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:58,120
If not you, then who?

173
00:11:59,519 --> 00:12:00,879
Your siblings?

174
00:12:01,480 --> 00:12:04,000
Our Rakshasa Bird clan
has no such sacrificial arts.

175
00:12:04,679 --> 00:12:07,840
Alright, we eat human eyeballs,

176
00:12:08,200 --> 00:12:10,440
but what use do we have
for human sacrifices?

177
00:12:11,360 --> 00:12:12,480
Can we eat them?

178
00:12:13,799 --> 00:12:15,399
You wicked demon,

179
00:12:15,600 --> 00:12:17,559
you keep barking about Jinshan Temple.

180
00:12:17,559 --> 00:12:18,720
What did Jinshan Temple do

181
00:12:19,679 --> 00:12:21,039
for you to spout such nonsense?

182
00:12:22,879 --> 00:12:24,879
A Jinshan disciple toyed with my sister

183
00:12:24,879 --> 00:12:26,840
and slaughtered our clan
on their wedding day.

184
00:12:26,840 --> 00:12:28,039
How do you not deserve to die?

185
00:12:29,639 --> 00:12:31,440
But everyone at Jinshan Temple
is a monk.

186
00:12:31,639 --> 00:12:32,799
How could anyone marry her?

187
00:12:32,799 --> 00:12:35,799
Exactly. If you're going to lie,
make it believable.

188
00:12:36,639 --> 00:12:37,639
Don't believe me?

189
00:12:38,799 --> 00:12:41,480
Go ahead and use the Truth Spell on me

190
00:12:41,840 --> 00:12:42,919
to see if I'm lying!

191
00:12:54,679 --> 00:12:58,200
(The Rakshasa Bird clan hasn't had
such a grand celebration in ages.)

192
00:12:58,360 --> 00:12:59,840
(I heard the groom isn't a demon.)

193
00:12:59,840 --> 00:13:01,039
(What kind of big shot is he?)

194
00:13:02,080 --> 00:13:03,919
Although I don't really like him,

195
00:13:04,480 --> 00:13:07,000
seeing you so happy,

196
00:13:07,320 --> 00:13:09,879
I wish you eternal love.

197
00:13:10,480 --> 00:13:11,600
Thank you, little sis.

198
00:13:12,600 --> 00:13:14,039
Go fetch my golden hairpin.

199
00:13:14,720 --> 00:13:17,559
Sister, you already look stunning today.

200
00:13:38,600 --> 00:13:39,600
Changming?

201
00:13:40,679 --> 00:13:43,440
Changming, why did you kill her?

202
00:13:43,960 --> 00:13:45,200
Heavenly righteousness,

203
00:13:45,480 --> 00:13:46,679
slay all evil demons!

204
00:13:48,799 --> 00:13:50,080
Why rush to kill her?

205
00:13:51,039 --> 00:13:54,000
Are you also involved in this?

206
00:13:54,440 --> 00:13:56,559
I am Changming, a disciple training

207
00:13:56,559 --> 00:13:59,399
at the foot of Jinshan Temple.

208
00:13:59,799 --> 00:14:02,120
She carries the blood
of seven Jinshan Temple disciples.

209
00:14:02,360 --> 00:14:04,279
Why shouldn't I kill her?

210
00:14:04,639 --> 00:14:05,639
As for you two,

211
00:14:05,720 --> 00:14:06,720
as men of righteousness,

212
00:14:06,919 --> 00:14:09,000
you're consorting with a murderous demon

213
00:14:09,399 --> 00:14:10,960
and letting her spout lies

214
00:14:11,080 --> 00:14:12,320
to slander Jinshan Temple!

215
00:14:12,960 --> 00:14:15,440
Fahai, do you still not see your error?

216
00:14:15,879 --> 00:14:16,879
Even if she's a demon,

217
00:14:17,120 --> 00:14:18,600
what she said made sense.

218
00:14:18,879 --> 00:14:20,200
Something is suspicious.

219
00:14:20,360 --> 00:14:21,559
No need to silence her.

220
00:14:21,759 --> 00:14:22,759
Exactly!

221
00:14:23,240 --> 00:14:25,039
You killed her
without getting any answers.

222
00:14:25,440 --> 00:14:27,879
Then how will Jinshan Temple
ever clear its name?

223
00:14:29,360 --> 00:14:32,200
Fine, keep believing a demon's words!

224
00:14:32,679 --> 00:14:36,240
Do you really think Jinshan Temple
wronged the Rakshasa Bird clan first?

225
00:14:37,200 --> 00:14:38,519
Of course we don't think that.

226
00:14:38,519 --> 00:14:40,240
Then what do you think, Fahai?

227
00:14:40,240 --> 00:14:42,279
As the head disciple of Jinshan Temple,

228
00:14:42,600 --> 00:14:44,360
your mind is corrupted by demons.

229
00:14:45,399 --> 00:14:48,240
No wonder you haven't mastered
the Leifeng Pagoda in ten years,

230
00:14:48,639 --> 00:14:50,519
nor have you been ordained!

231
00:14:52,679 --> 00:14:53,679
Farewell.

232
00:15:26,530 --> 00:15:30,689
♪I also gave my youth to someone♪

233
00:15:33,156 --> 00:15:37,534
♪I must admit, you made the journey♪

234
00:15:39,077 --> 00:15:44,902
♪When loving you
became instinct, what's left♪

235
00:15:45,671 --> 00:15:50,138
♪Seals a fate too brutal to amend♪

236
00:15:53,003 --> 00:15:57,444
♪Clumsy and new, we gave our first kiss♪

237
00:15:59,640 --> 00:16:04,370
♪Never thought passionate eyes
would turn cold♪

238
00:16:05,582 --> 00:16:11,695
♪I thought of pulling away,
but I'd barely begun♪

239
00:16:12,358 --> 00:16:18,140
♪Having loved you so deep,
how could I love another♪

240
00:16:18,140 --> 00:16:24,403
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

241
00:16:24,713 --> 00:16:31,072
♪Though I'm stubborn,
I never stopped you from loving others♪

242
00:16:31,243 --> 00:16:38,610
♪I shouldn't have been so foolish
to think there was still hope♪

243
00:16:38,895 --> 00:16:44,442
♪But you won't even admit what we had♪

244
00:16:44,933 --> 00:16:51,143
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

245
00:16:51,453 --> 00:16:58,226
♪Though I have questions,
I never questioned you♪

246
00:16:59,223 --> 00:17:04,876
♪I'll lock you away and set myself free♪

247
00:17:05,710 --> 00:17:10,118
♪After all, I'm the one you deny♪

248
00:17:10,883 --> 00:17:13,471
♪Having ever loved♪
